      "item": "theoreticalsciences:warp_field_forge",
      "title": "Warp Field Forge",
      "text": "Shapes a bubble of flat space inside a wall of negative energy: contracted ahead, expanded behind.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 4$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "This controller is too complex for a crafting grid. Build it on the $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$() - check JEI for the exact parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Set the bubble's speed (in c), its radius and the sharpness of its wall. The negative energy it needs grows as v\u00b2R\u00b2\u03c3; the tidal shear at the wall as v\u03c3 (a passenger is torn apart above 5); a wall too thick for its radius (R\u03c3 < 10) leaks. A Warp Bubble Core must be superluminal."
    },
